      "value": "<p>You tap into the power of two elemental planes, mix their energy together, and then release it around you in a powerful explosion, dealing 8d8 damage. Select two of the following damage types when you cast this spell: acid, cold, electricity, fire. The damage dealt by this spell is of both types (half one and half the other). For 1 hour, the area is difficult terrain.</p>"
